# Agent optimization

- Session start: `team/ADAPTER-PROMPT.md` + 4-doc pickup (STATE, HANDOFF, role AGENTS, latest session).
- Use Plan mode for architecture; Agent mode for implementation.
- Parallel blueprints → separate git worktrees/branches.
- Keep context small: read blueprint sections by ID, not entire trees.
- Prefer `db:validate` and health endpoints over guessing connection strings.
- Enable provider MCP (Supabase, MongoDB) when documented in `docs/databases/ai-agent-database-setup.md`.
